{"title":"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 12","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1(logical_solution)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1(logical solution)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2(algebra_solution)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2(algebra solution)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_by_MathTalks\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video by MathTalks</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/9/a39b14023c98c943554d150561aacc188c4ce26d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$500$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> balls in a large bag, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/7/bb7e03ccc8985ba9d029ea4add6e3e15ab9a953a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$80\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" /> are red and the rest are blue. How many of the red balls must be removed so that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/2/e126f0d41c904d37ba2c332347a24b75d4ac3066.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$75\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> of the remaining balls are red?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/b/72be252bbb79110823eddc90c70cdf96e3560469.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 25\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 50\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 75\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 100\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 150$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"412\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_1.28logical_solution.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1(logical_solution)\">Solution 1(logical solution)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1(logical solution)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since 80 percent of the 500 balls are red, there are 400 red balls. Therefore, there must be 100 blue balls. For the 100 blue balls to be 25% or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/5/415dd5722f2b57ce55e47766ccb11a0cdc4eb051.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{1}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"11\" height=\"37\" /> of the bag, there must be 400 balls in the bag so 100 red balls must be removed. The answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/3/2e3f613160ac97a93aa44106a056382080c3ff0d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"74\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2.28algebra_solution.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2(algebra_solution)\">Solution 2(algebra solution)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2(algebra solution)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We could also set up a proportion. Since we know there are 400 red balls, we let the amount of red balls removed be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/b/51b2868f1e25485e077c5bb46df224fbcbc09a66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{400-x}{500-x}=\\frac{3}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"99\" height=\"38\" />. Cross-multiplying gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/7/3c7f4178886941160880bd876852d33b0a3443af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1600-4x=1500-3x \\implies x=100$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"291\" height=\"13\" />, so our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/3/2e3f613160ac97a93aa44106a056382080c3ff0d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"74\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Before any balls are taken out of the bag, there are 400 red balls. Let the number of red balls we take out of the bag be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />. Since we want the number of red ball to be 75% of the remaining balls, we can set up the equation: \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/5/305f19269e693907d17e215e343ff2966fe07341.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.75(500–x)=400–x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"167\" height=\"20\" />.\nIn words, 75% of the total remaining balls are equal to the remaining red balls. \nSolving we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/8/6d8f8e9675091b6c67807f22cedce7360d82b43f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=100$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"61\" height=\"13\" />, so our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/3/2e3f613160ac97a93aa44106a056382080c3ff0d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"74\" height=\"28\" />.\n~J.L.L\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_by_MathTalks\">Video by MathTalks</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video by MathTalks\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6hRHZxSieKc\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6hRHZxSieKc</a>\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8\" title=\"2010 AMC 8\">2010 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2010\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b